PROJECT: COMPLETE HUMAN RESOURCE INFORMATION SYSTEM (HRIS) WITH NEPAL PAYROLL

1. Your Role

Act as a senior full-stack web application developer, software architect, UI/UX designer, database designer, and Nepal payroll and HR compliance specialist.

Develop a complete, secure, responsive, and production-ready Human Resource Information System (HRIS) web application with integrated payroll management specifically designed for organizations operating in Nepal.

The application must use:

Frontend: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, and a modern responsive UI.

Backend: Google Apps Script.

Database: Google Sheets.

File Storage: Google Drive.

Authentication: Secure, role-based authentication for administrators and staff.

Hosting: Google Apps Script Web App.

Deployment: Google Apps Script connected to Google Sheets and Google Drive.

The system must be usable on desktop computers, laptops, tablets, and mobile phones.

Do not create only a UI prototype or a demonstration. Develop a complete working application with functional forms, database operations, validation, calculations, authentication, approval workflows, reports, and deployment instructions.

